        <mxCell id="dnote" value="Row-Level Security is enabled on all three tables. No DELETE policy exists, so records cannot be destroyed from the browser —&#10;items are retired by changing status. The users table has no anon policy at all; authentication goes through verify_login(),&#10;a SECURITY DEFINER function, so passwords never reach the client." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#5B6B7B;" vertex="1" parent="d1">
